# 3. Data Dictionary

## Employees Table

| Column | Data Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| employee_id | Text | Unique employee identifier |
| full_name | Text | Employee name |
| department_id | Text | Department identifier |
| job_level | Text | Employee job level |
| gender | Text | Employee gender |
| tenure_years | Decimal | Employee tenure in years |
| salary | Integer | Employee annual salary |
| satisfaction_score | Decimal | Employee satisfaction score |
| performance_rating | Text | Employee performance category |
| manager_id | Text | Manager identifier |
| hire_date | Date | Employee hiring date |
| employment_status | Text | Current employment status |
| last_promotion_years | Integer | Years since last promotion |
| Age | Integer | Employee age |
| Tenure Band | Text | Categorized employee tenure |
| Salary Band | Text | Categorized salary range |
| Age Group | Text | Categorized employee age |

## Attrition Events Table

| Column | Data Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| employee_id | Text | Employee associated with the attrition event |
| exit_date | Date | Employee departure date |
| exit_reason | Text | Reason for employee departure |
| destination | Text | Employee destination after leaving |

## Departments Table

| Column | Data Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| department_id | Text | Unique department identifier |
| department_name | Text | Department name |
| headcount_budget | Integer | Planned department headcount |
